    "boundary": "Fresh non-exposed seekable VP8/ALPH Stream to independent owned RGBA8. Complete default managed input buffering/copies and EOF reading, full public Decode/disposal. Native fresh AVIO/owned packet acquisition, complete reading/EOF, software webp state reset/decode, centered chroma expansion, limited BT601 through RGBA16/no-dither reduction, exact alpha merge and all input/scratch/output acquisition/release timed. Decoder/conversion/frame/packet wrappers reused; every call reacquires input and decodes/converts all pixels. No demux, exposed input-buffer shortcut, output cache or redundant packing. One CPU/codec/conversion thread, normal SIMD. Startup/I/O/IPC/generation/hashing/validation excluded. Existing frozen input and exact per-decoder pixel anchors reused; no encoding or quality search.",
